@props(title:text)
<article class="about article-body"><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT FIELDNOTES</span><h1>A place for<br><em>good ideas.</em></h1><p class="article-deck">We are a small, fictional editorial team with a simple belief: the useful ideas are often hiding in ordinary things.</p><section><h2>Take a closer look</h2><p>A well-made tool. A clear explanation. A quiet moment that changes how you see the rest of the day. Fieldnotes collects perspectives on design, engineering, and the everyday.</p></section><section id="stay-curious"><h2>Stay curious</h2><p>Start with a story, follow a question, and see where it takes you. There is no sign-up wall here.</p><a class="text-link" href="/">Explore the journal ↗</a></section><aside class="article-note">This is a native NeoKit example with searchable SSR pages, dynamic article routes, optional browser enhancement, and static export. Edit posts.neo to publish your own stories.</aside></article>
